{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42746","headline":"秋夕书怀呈戎州郎中 一 · 刘兼","name":"秋夕书怀呈戎州郎中 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"素律初回枕簟凉，松风飘泊入华堂。\n谭鸡寂默纱窗静，梦蝶萧条玉漏长。\n归去水云多阻隔，别来情绪足悲伤。\n霜砧月笛休相引，只有离襟泪两行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42746.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42746","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}